<title>POLAND: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>POLAND GOVERNMENT LIST (970101)</p>
<p> President (Sworn in 23 Dec 95).........Aleksander KWASNIEWSKI</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>COALITION GOVERNMENT (Apptd 7 Feb 96):</p>
